  "assistantText": "\n\nSudah saya cek dan fix.\n\nRoot cause:\n- UI backend form membaca `activity_packages.package_name` langsung, makanya tampil `Rafting`.\n- API `/api/v1/activities/:slug` pakai `ActivityPackageSerializer`, lalu ambil `activity_package.translated_package_name(locale)`.\n- Method itu sebelumnya memprioritaskan `translations['en']['package_name']`.\n- Jadi kalau data translation EN masih lama (`Standard Rafting`), API menimpa nilai backend terbaru (`Rafting`).\n\nPerubahan:\n- `app/models/activity_package.rb`\n  - Untuk locale `en`, sekarang `translated_package_name` selalu pakai kolom utama `package_name`.\n  - Translation JSON tetap dipakai untuk locale non-EN seperti `id`.\n\nTest/regression:\n- `spec/requests/api/v1/activities_spec.rb`\n  - Saya tambah kasus: `package_name` backend = `Beach Day Tour`, tapi translation EN lama = `Old Beach Package`.\n  - API EN harus tetap return `Beach Day Tour`.\n  - API ID tetap return translation `Tur Pantai Sehari`.\n\nVerifikasi:\n- `bin/bundle exec rspec spec/requests/api/v1/activities_spec.rb` ✅ 20 examples, 0 failures\n- `bin/bundle exec rspec spec/requests/api/v1/activity_packages_spec.rb` ✅ 2 examples, 0 failures\n\nCatatan:\n- Belum saya commit/deploy.\n- Ada beberapa file lain yang sudah modified dari pekerjaan sebelumnya, saya hanya ubah:\n  - `app/models/activity_package.rb`\n ",
